{"page":580,"verses":[{"verse_key":"76:26","surah":76,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنَ ٱلَّيْلِ فَٱسْجُدْ لَهُۥ وَسَبِّحْهُ لَيْلًا طَوِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"bow down before Him, and glorify Him at length by night.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And of","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"76:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"the night","transliteration":"al-layli","verse_key":"76:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَٱسْجُدْ","en_gloss":"prostrate","transliteration":"fa-us'jud","verse_key":"76:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"76:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَسَبِّحْهُ","en_gloss":"and glorify Him","transliteration":"wasabbiḥ'hu","verse_key":"76:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَيْلًۭا","en_gloss":"a night","transliteration":"laylan","verse_key":"76:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"طَوِيلًا","en_gloss":"long","transliteration":"ṭawīlan","verse_key":"76:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"76:26"}]},{"verse_key":"76:27","surah":76,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ يُحِبُّونَ ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ وَيَذَرُونَ وَرَآءَهُمْ يَوْمًا ثَقِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"These people love the fleeting life. They put aside [all thoughts of] a Heavy Day.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"76:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"these","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"76:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُحِبُّونَ","en_gloss":"love","transliteration":"yuḥibbūna","verse_key":"76:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ","en_gloss":"the immediate","transliteration":"l-ʿājilata","verse_key":"76:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَيَذَرُونَ","en_gloss":"and leave","transliteration":"wayadharūna","verse_key":"76:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَرَآءَهُمْ","en_gloss":"behind them","transliteration":"warāahum","verse_key":"76:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a Day","transliteration":"yawman","verse_key":"76:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثَقِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"grave","transliteration":"thaqīlan","verse_key":"76:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"76:27"}]},{"verse_key":"76:28","surah":76,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"نَّحْنُ خَلَقْنَـٰهُمْ وَشَدَدْنَآ أَسْرَهُمْ ۖ وَإِذَا شِئْنَا بَدَّلْنَآ أَمْثَـٰلَهُمْ تَبْدِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet We created them; We strengthened their constitution; if We please, We can replace such people completely.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"نَّحْنُ","en_gloss":"We","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خَلَقْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"created them","transliteration":"khalaqnāhum","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَشَدَدْنَآ","en_gloss":"and We strengthened","transliteration":"washadadnā","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَسْرَهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"their forms","transliteration":"asrahum","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"and when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"شِئْنَا","en_gloss":"We will","transliteration":"shi'nā","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَدَّلْنَآ","en_gloss":"We can change","transliteration":"baddalnā","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَمْثَـٰلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their likeness[es]","transliteration":"amthālahum","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَبْدِيلًا","en_gloss":"(with) a change","transliteration":"tabdīlan","verse_key":"76:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"76:28"}]},{"verse_key":"76:29","surah":76,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ هَـٰذِهِۦ تَذْكِرَةٌ ۖ فَمَن شَآءَ ٱتَّخَذَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِۦ سَبِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is a reminder. Let whoever wishes, take the way to his Lord.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"76:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"هَـٰذِهِۦ","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhihi","verse_key":"76:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَذْكِرَةٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) a reminder","transliteration":"tadhkiratun","verse_key":"76:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَمَن","en_glos